37650>>>    Procedure OnNavigateForward tWebNavigateData NavigateData Integer hoInvokingView Integer hoInvokingObject
37653>>>        WebSet pbRender of oNewButton to True
37654>>>        WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to True
37655>>>
37655>>>        Case Begin
37655>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromParent)
37657>>>                // If from parent, this is a constrained drill down
37657>>>                Case Break
37658>>>
37658>>>            Case (NavigateData.eNavigateType = nfFromChild)
37661>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent lookup from a Zoom
37661>>>                Case Break
